    687  f0cc							; TIM64T expires on a 64-cycle tick, the poll exits up to 63c late, and
    688  f0cc							; the band-0 .Row setup WSYNC gap is ~75c — so the kernel start line
    689  f0cc							; oscillated ±1 with the tick phase (measured: first .Line WSYNC at scn
    690  f0cc							; 20 on 100 frames, scn 21 on 51 frames under bomb/thrust input = the
    691  f0cc							; whole-screen jitter, HUD seam flipping rows 144/194). The re-anchor
