   1084  f1f7							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1085  f1f7							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1086  f1f7							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1087  f1f7							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1088  f1f7							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
   1089  f1f7							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1090  f1f7				   UpdateP0Vertical
   1091  f1f7							; --- Clear HotBump (Temp b7) — set again only if this frame bumps hot rock ---
