   1686  f4db							; Room exit handlers — check connection table, switch rooms, reposition player
   1687  f4db							; ==============================================================================
   1688  f4db							; Connection table: 2 nibble-packed bytes per room (up<<4|down, left<<4|right),
   1689  f4db							; $F = no exit. After transition: player is placed at the OPPOSITE edge of the
   1690  f4db							; new room. Jetpack velocity carries over (matches comparison/hero pattern).
