   2360  f7fa							; $F82C pin gap (upstream of the $F8DD sprite pin, so the pre-pad END is
   2361  f7fa							; unaffected and the 15 B the folded chain frees stays free). Every non-raft arm
   2362  f7fa							; tail-jumps, exactly like the old inline chain, so the stack depth is unchanged.
