   2386  f81c							; CallPad_RaftBody — bank1 RaftBody entry. Pinned at $F8C0 with a
   2387  f81c							; BYTE-IDENTICAL twin in bank1 (bank1.asm, same address): the `sta $1FF7`
   2388  f81c							; switches banks, so the `jmp` opcode AND its operand are fetched from bank1,
   2389  f81c							; not from here. That is the same FoldIndirect discipline every other tramp
   2390  f81c							; uses — the twin cannot be skipped or shortened.
   2391  f81c							; Guard: verify_build.check_raft_tramp (identity + operand == bank1 RaftBody).
   2392  f81c		       00 00 00 00*	      .ds	$F8C0 - *, 0
