   3343  fd37							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3344  fd37							; TitleWork — merged title/level-select screen (DropTarget = $FD sentinel,
   3345  fd37							; dispatched from DropStep every frame). The TitleKernel shows the logo, the
   3346  fd37							; selected level number (digits band) and the credits; the theme plays here.
   3347  fd37							; No gravity/enemies/sound beyond the music (frame is title-owned; timer
   3348  fd37							; frozen). SELECT cycles Level, RESET starts the game at the selected level.
   3349  fd37							;   SELECT (SWCHB b1, active-low EDGE) → jsr TitleSelect (fill): level+1,
   3350  fd37							;	    wrap → 000001, reload room 0 (swallow removed 2026-10-07, 8b —
   3351  fd37							;	    the intro exit ate the first press and made #2 read as dead)
   3352  fd37							;   RESET  (SWCHB b0, active-low EDGE) → score 000000, LoadLevel tail arms
   3353  fd37							;	    the real drop-in → gameplay starts
   3354  fd37							; ($FD reaches here directly — merged title, 2026-10-19.)
   3355  fd37							; StepsLeft = previous SWCHB sample (physics is skipped on title, so it is
   3356  fd37							; title-owned; the first play frame rewrites it as the step budget).
   3357  fd37							; Console switches are read again after any jsr (LoadLevel clobbers X/Y/A).
   3358  fd37							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
