   3456  fda8							; BuildColupF — 12-byte final COLUPF image at ColupfBuf ($E7-$F2).
   3457  fda8							;   Stripe: rows 0,2 = LevelWallColor; row 1 = LevelWallColor2.
   3458  fda8							;   Hot rows overwrite with TickCounter-bit4 pulse (COLOR_HOT_Y/R).
   3459  fda8							;   $F0-$F2 (bombs) NO LONGER overlap-saved: body writes rows 0-2 only,
   3460  fda8							;   save/restore round trip deleted (S3.0b — window audit: zero writers).
   3461  fda8							;   Bank1 clobbers $E0-$EF during HUD; VBLANK rebuilds every frame.
