   3574  fe00							; ObjColorTab — per-scanline GRP1 object colors, stride 8 = ObjSprites
   3575  fe00							; stride; indexed by the same X = ObjBase + r in .Grp1 at $FE00 (4c, same
   3576  fe00							; page for all 72 B — the passing +7 probe's exact cycle sum). Row colors
